# Secondary safety net, not the primary defense: this session's Read/Grep/
# Bash calls are hook-redirected to lean-ctx's ctx_* tools, which are
# already .gitignore-aware on their own (see ctx_search's tool description) —
# so node_modules/.next/.venv were already excluded from ctx_search before
# this file existed. This still matters for tools the hook doesn't catch
# (native Glob isn't in the PreToolUse matcher list) and for files that are
# tracked, not gitignored, but still noise (pnpm-lock.yaml).

node_modules/
apps/web/node_modules/
apps/web/.next/
.turbo/

apps/api/.venv/
apps/api/__pycache__/
apps/api/**/__pycache__/
apps/api/*.egg-info/
apps/api/.pytest_cache/

pnpm-lock.yaml
*.lock

.git/
.lean-ctx/
.logs/

dist/
build/
coverage/
*.min.js
*.min.css
